        "depth_source_code":null,
        "revision_note":"WSP 859:  1921-23.  WSP 1313:  1914-21.\n&lt;p&gt;The maximum discharge and date of the peak for water year 1884 were revised on May 30, 2024. The original USGS estimate was incorrectly revised to 300,000 ft&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;/s in 1938. This revision is rescinded as of May 30, 2024. The month and day of the event were also removed, as there are contradicting reports and no clear evidence for a specific date. &lt;span&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The maximum discharge for water year 1921 was revised on May 30, 2024. The original USGS estimate was incorrectly revised to 220,000 ft&lt;sup&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;/s in 1938. This revision is rescinded as of May 30, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;See USGS Professional Paper 1677 for additional information about the 1884 and 1921 water year peaks.&lt;/p&gt;",
